+  const core = () => loop().core
+  // Live and replay alike (M4 batch 3): the lane flows and the core turns while the main agent works; idle, they breathe.
+  // One steady speed (changing the duration mid-turn makes the ring jump). The gap between steps (a task finishing,
+  // the next request starting) is not idle: motion stops only after IDLE_MS of quiet, and then pauses in place
+  // (oco-loop-rest) so it resumes from where it was instead of restarting.
